{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Clown is back. Now Super clown mission is to find stars in 16 different level. End of every level there is boss. 2 different boss. Green virus or Sorcerer depending on level. Bosses shoot bunnies.\u00a0Kill boss enemies by jumping 3 times on to his head and after boss is death gate is disappeared and player can collect star to finish levels.<br>There is also other normal enemies like following slimes, walking zombies and running zombies. Also shooting cannons which shoot bunnies. Those all can be killed by jumping on to their head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also traps like spikes and different platforms like jumping platforms, disappearing platforms and moving platforms. Falling from map will kill super clown and he need start from start point. Player can collect hearths to get more health. So can you be the hero super clown and beat all bosses and collect all stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17levels <br>- Different enemies: Following virus slimes, walking skeletons, running skeletons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannons which shoots bunnies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 different bosses: Virus and Sorcerer who shoot bunnies<br>- Traps like spikes<br>- Steam achievements. Beat boss and unlock gate and collect star to get steam achievement<br>- Hearth which give more energy<br>- Jumping Platforms, Moving platforms, Switch platforms<br>- Falling from map will kill player</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Find star Candy land","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957590/fdb0d2a7bf2938083d072222f3778de874ea1545.jpg"},{"name":"Find star Valkeala town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3957590/ed905b6dbd01d7408814fc48ec916798b1377360.jpg"},{"name":"Find star cave","path":"https://cdn.akam